# File:  ec_trace_store.dpi
# Authors: Tyler Lesthaeghe
# Created: 2026-10-02
# Description:
#   Writes an eddy-current scan's traces to disk one pass at a time, and
#   rebuilds the projected image from those files alone.
# Derived From:
#
#########################################################################
# Revision Log
#
# 2026-10-02:  Initial Commit
